WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.340
Two colleagues chat over coffee before Bartek's presentation.

2
00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:08.110
Szef ma dziś muchy w nosie.

3
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:14.060
Literally, flies in his nose: he is in a bad mood.

4
00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:17.230
Nie mój cyrk, nie moje małpy.

5
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:22.220
Not my circus, not my monkeys: not my problem.

6
00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:24.510
Trzymam za ciebie kciuki.

7
00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.940
Holding thumbs: fingers crossed.

8
00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.390
To bułka z masłem.

9
00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:34.500
A bread roll with butter: a piece of cake.

10
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:40.730
Mówić do niego to jak rzucać grochem o ścianę.

11
00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:45.650
Idioms cannot be translated word by word.

12
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Use them in informal speech, not in formal writing.

13
00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.320
Wish your friend luck.

14
00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:59.460
Trzymam za ciebie kciuki.

15
00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:04.020
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

16
00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:07.460
Trzymam za ciebie kciuki.

17
00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:12.660
Say that something is very easy.

18
00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:16.960
To bułka z masłem.

19
00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:21.520
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

20
00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:25.120
To bułka z masłem.

21
00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:30.760
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
